            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "summary": "Costs round half-up once per range. Coverage counts intervals between reads\nno more than 30s apart. An expired leading partial hour is omitted, not estimated.\nGPU energy uses the same covered UPS intervals and right-endpoint rounding.\nIt is null if GPU coverage is missing or its energy exceeds the UPS load.",
        "tags": []
      }
    },
